# idiomatic layer for the OpenGL core profile (generated)
#
# snake_case wrappers over gl.c, one per command. GLboolean becomes bool and a
# single const GLchar* name argument becomes str at the boundary; buffers, data
# pointers, and scalar out-params keep their C-faithful pointer types.
#
# generated by tools/gen.py from the pinned tools/gl.xml. do not edit by hand.

